<title>UK: Sainsbury sets 300 mln Ffr structured bond.</title>
<headline>Sainsbury sets 300 mln Ffr structured bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager J.P. Morgan.</p>
<p> BORROWER   J. SAINSBURY</p>
<p> AMT    300 MLN FFR   COUPON    *4.00	MATURITY    20.JUN.05</p>
<p> TYPE   TEC 10 LINKED ISS PRICE  100.40    PAY DATE    20.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  40 BP     REOFFER    100.40    SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA3/A+    LISTING    PARIS     DENOMS (K)   100</p>
<p> NOTES     *FOR FIRST FOUR YEARS THEN COUPON IS TEC 10 MINUS 23</p>
<p>BP. - London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
